{"id":"g2142","title":"Wecesin®","description":"Zur äußeren Anwendung bei nässenden Entzündungen der Haut, z. B. zur Nabelpflege bei Neugeborenen oder bei intertriginösen und interdigitalen Ekzemen.","blocks":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Bemerkungen:"}]},{"type":"text","text":" Wecesin® ist als Pulver bei WELEDA erhältlich und als Rezepturpräparat bei der Apotheke an der Weleda auch als Salbe verfügbar. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Hersteller"}]},{"type":"text","text":": WELEDA. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Zusammensetzung"}]},{"type":"text","text":": 10 g Pulver enthalten 0,5 g Arnica montana, Planta tota; 0,3 g Calendula officinalis Ø; 0,09 g Echinacea purpurea, Planta tota Ø; 0,3 g Echinacea Ø; 0,01 g Quarz; 0,01 g Stibium metallicum praeparatum. "}]}]}]},{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"children":[{"type":"text","text":"Indikationen"}]}]},{"type":"group","id":"indication","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"heading","level":4,"children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"text","text":" Feucht-entzündliche Nabelveränderung bei Neugeborenen, Nabelpflege "}]}]},{"type":"group","id":"a1878","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Dosierung"}]},{"type":"text","text":": 3–4 x tgl. lokal anwenden. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Wirkungseintritt"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Rasches Abtrocknen des Nabels binnen 1–2 Tg. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Therapiedauer"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Bis zur Abheilung. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Nebenwirkungen"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Keine. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Bemerkungen"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Vermeiden, dass das Pulver versehentlich in die Nase/Atemwege des Säuglings gelangt. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Berichtende Ärzte"}]},{"type":"text","text":": GS, RS. "}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"heading","level":4,"children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"text","text":" Nässende intertriginöse Ekzeme "}]}]},{"type":"group","id":"a1879","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"text","text":" Z.B. submammär, inguinal, auch interdigital. "}]},{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Dosierung"}]},{"type":"text","text":": 2 x tgl. bis mehrfach tgl. lokales Aufbringen mit Kompressen. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Wirkungseintritt"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Kontinuierliche Besserung. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Therapiedauer"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Nach Bedarf. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Weitere Empfehlungen"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Begleitbehandlung bei stark nässender Intertrigo: Kompressen mit Equisetum-Tee. Bei im Vordergrund stehender Mykose "},{"type":"inline","id":"12937","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Oleum aethereum Rosmarini 10 %"}]},{"type":"text","text":" WELEDA (vgl. "},{"type":"link","href":"/offline/documents/med/de05/g0399.html","id":"12938","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Rosmarinus (ext.)"}]},{"type":"text","text":") oder Thymian 5 %. Bei juckender Intertrigo "},{"type":"link","href":"/offline/documents/med/de05/g2253.html","id":"12939","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Quercus Salbe"}]},{"type":"text","text":" WALA. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Berichtende Ärzte"}]},{"type":"text","text":": MK, GS, RS. "}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"heading","id":"01JJ73XFEG37R12Y8BRAEDFY1M","level":4,"children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"text","text":" Zugelassenes Anwendungsgebiet "}]}]},{"type":"group","id":"application-01JJ73XFEG37R12Y8BRAEDFY1M","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Zur Anregung und Strukturierung der Haut- und Schleimhautregeneration bei oberflächlichen, abtrocknenden Wunden und Ekzemen sowie zur Nabelpflege bei Neugeborenen. (Indikation gilt für WELEDA, Wecesin® Pulver.)"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"heading","id":"R2142","level":4,"children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"text","text":" Literatur "}]}]},{"type":"group","id":"literature-R2142","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Bott V, Schramm H. Mensch und Heilmittel. Handbuch und Ratgeber zur Behandlung mit anthroposophischen Heilmitteln. Schaffhausen: Novalis 1992; 145."}]}]}]}]}]}]}